      <h1>Niger &mdash; <span>Land of Ancient Empires</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-tagline">Where the Songhai ruled, where Agadez gleamed gold, where the Sahara held its secrets &mdash; and where the world's uranium powers French lights while Nigeriens live in the dark.</div>
